  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44246068",
      "title": "Sending an HTTP Request via a Form Action",
      "sourceHash": "d1313a8aac9c0629f1c21fe2ab23b61e664f9a0bafc6ca27c286d88f62fbaf0d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.65,
          "en": "So how can we send a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.65,
          "end": 8.97,
          "en": "to the backend here when these forms are being triggered?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.97,
          "end": 12.84,
          "en": "Well, we can again go to our context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.84,
          "end": 15.81,
          "en": "and then there in upvoteOpinion,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.81,
          "end": 18.123,
          "en": "add the code for sending a request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.709,
          "end": 23.01,
          "en": "So we can turn this into a async function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.01,
          "end": 27.851,
          "en": "and then here call await to await the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.851,
          "end": 32.851,
          "en": "of calling fetch, and fetch is used to send the request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.21,
          "end": 35.07,
          "en": "The request then should be sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 35.07,
          "end": 40.07,
          "en": "to localhost:3000/opinions/",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 40.56,
          "end": 43.83,
          "en": "and then if you take a look at the backend code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 43.83,
          "end": 47.84,
          "en": "the ID of the vote that you wanna upvote",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 47.84,
          "end": 50.853,
          "en": "is required as part of this path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 53.4,
          "end": 56.13,
          "en": "So therefore we should actually concatenate the ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 56.13,
          "end": 58.713,
          "en": "which I'm also expecting as a argument here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 60.18,
          "end": 62.73,
          "en": "And thereafter, we add more to this path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 62.73,
          "end": 64.803,
          "en": "and we add /upvote.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 67.62,
          "end": 71.34,
          "en": "So we must make sure that this ID is being passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 71.34,
          "end": 74.43,
          "en": "to upvoteOpinion when that function is being called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 74.43,
          "end": 76.08,
          "en": "That's something to keep in mind.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 77.37,
          "end": 80.22,
          "en": "Now, if you take a closer look at the backend code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 80.22,
          "end": 82.98,
          "en": "you'll also see that it's a post request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 82.98,
          "end": 84.423,
          "en": "that is expected here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 85.56,
          "end": 87.42,
          "en": "So back in our context file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 87.42,
          "end": 89.31,
          "en": "we have to configure this request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 89.31,
          "end": 92.13,
          "en": "and set the method to POST.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 92.13,
          "end": 95.91,
          "en": "Well and then, as you learned, we'll get back a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 95.91,
          "end": 100.17,
          "en": "and we can check if the response is maybe not okay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 100.17,
          "end": 103.35,
          "en": "so if some error response was sent back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 103.35,
          "end": 105.42,
          "en": "In which case I wanna return here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 105.42,
          "end": 108.39,
          "en": "so that this code won't execute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 108.39,
          "end": 112.5,
          "en": "because in this code I'm updating my votes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 112.5,
          "end": 115.11,
          "en": "for this opinion here on the front end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 115.11,
          "end": 118.77000000000001,
          "en": "And I only want to do that if we have a success response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 118.77000000000001,
          "end": 122.043,
          "en": "So if the votes really were updated on the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 123.06,
          "end": 124.98,
          "en": "After this check, it should be safe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 124.98,
          "end": 127.383,
          "en": "to update those opinions though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.79,
          "end": 130.5,
          "en": "Well actually, for technical reasons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.5,
          "end": 133.23,
          "en": "it would be a good idea to also wrap this request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.23,
          "end": 137.34,
          "en": "with try catch since we could run into some technical issue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 137.34,
          "end": 139.56,
          "en": "But to keep this code simple and lean,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.56,
          "end": 141.78,
          "en": "I'll not do that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.78,
          "end": 143.853,
          "en": "And therefore this should now work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.72,
          "end": 147.06,
          "en": "We of course should do something similar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 147.06,
          "end": 151.98,
          "en": "in the downvoteOpinion function in this context file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.98,
          "end": 154.65,
          "en": "So I'll copy and paste that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.65,
          "end": 157.02,
          "en": "and add async here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 157.02,
          "end": 161.463,
          "en": "But now the request must be sent to /downvote here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.77,
          "end": 166.353,
          "en": "Other than that, everything should be fine though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.46,
          "end": 170.82,
          "en": "And now back in the opinion component file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.82,
          "end": 174,
          "en": "instead of logging upvote or downvote,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174,
          "end": 175.74,
          "en": "we of course should make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175.74,
          "end": 178.623,
          "en": "that these context functions are invoked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.61,
          "end": 183.03,
          "en": "So again, as before, you should import use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 183.03,
          "end": 188.03,
          "en": "or useContext, one of these two hooks from React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 188.04,
          "end": 190.293,
          "en": "so that you get hold of the context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 191.58,
          "end": 193.383,
          "en": "So I'll call useOpinionContext,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 195.779,
          "end": 199.623,
          "en": "OpinionsContext to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 200.49,
          "end": 203.79,
          "en": "And then I'll destructure this context object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 203.79,
          "end": 208.79,
          "en": "to pull out the downvote and upvote opinion functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 208.92000000000002,
          "end": 210.393,
          "en": "on which we just worked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 212.64,
          "end": 216.93,
          "en": "So upvoteOpinion and downvoteOpinion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 216.93,
          "end": 219.12,
          "en": "are pulled out of the context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 219.12,
          "end": 221.64,
          "en": "And then here in upvoteAction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 221.64,
          "end": 223.323,
          "en": "I want to call upvoteOpinion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 225.24,
          "end": 228.333,
          "en": "And in downvoteAction, it's downvoteOpinion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 230.16,
          "end": 233.55,
          "en": "Now of course these functions yield promises.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 233.55,
          "end": 235.44,
          "en": "These are async functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 235.44,
          "end": 239.7,
          "en": "So we should also create async actions here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 239.7,
          "end": 243.78,
          "en": "so that React will wait for these action functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 243.78,
          "end": 247.32,
          "en": "to complete in case we wanna update the UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 247.32,
          "end": 248.553,
          "en": "based on their state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 250.02,
          "end": 252.153,
          "en": "And then await this here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 253.587,
          "end": 256.71,
          "en": "And of course, both functions require the ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 256.71,
          "end": 259.503,
          "en": "which we conveniently get as a prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 260.67,
          "end": 264.78,
          "en": "So we should pass that to upvote and downvoteOpinion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 264.78,
          "end": 267.87,
          "en": "And that's why these action functions must be created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 267.87,
          "end": 271.08,
          "en": "in this component here, so that we do have access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 271.08,
          "end": 272.673,
          "en": "to this ID prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 274.62,
          "end": 278.94,
          "en": "With that, if you save this, if you reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 278.94,
          "end": 282.75,
          "en": "if I click this upvote button, nothing happens initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 282.75,
          "end": 285.423,
          "en": "but after a second, this changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 286.59000000000003,
          "end": 290.64,
          "en": "And it takes a second because on that backend code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 290.64,
          "end": 293.37,
          "en": "I again have this artificial delay here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 293.37,
          "end": 295.743,
          "en": "to simulate a slow backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 297.3,
          "end": 298.38,
          "en": "Now that of course means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 298.38,
          "end": 301.14,
          "en": "that the same is true when we downvote.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 301.14,
          "end": 304.083,
          "en": "It takes a short while until this is reflected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 305.19,
          "end": 307.74,
          "en": "which of course means that we get some strange behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 307.74,
          "end": 309.99,
          "en": "if I hammer this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 309.99,
          "end": 313.353,
          "en": "because then it looks really weird if it changes like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 315.6,
          "end": 318.3,
          "en": "Now if I reload, those votes are also there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 318.3,
          "end": 321.27,
          "en": "because they really were stored on the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 321.27,
          "end": 324.813,
          "en": "But now it's time to improve the user experience here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}